WEBVTT

00:00:02.109 --> 00:00:05.279
Once, when many planets
intermingled and

00:00:05.613 --> 00:00:08.716
the boundary between man
and god was vague...

00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:14.221
There was a tale of a particular family.
A tale of love and rebirth.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:27.167
Sometimes I think things over.
It helps to cheer me up.

00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:37.678
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:00:40.848 --> 00:00:44.552
This place has always
meant everything to me.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.857
It rains so beautifully here.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:55.296
I can dance like the wind.

00:00:57.798 --> 00:01:00.801
Even now, I'm having fun.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.640
I have a better sense of
rhythm than you'd think.

00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:12.313
It felt as though every time
I heard a certain someone's voice,

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:22.723
I would think back to how
I grew up surrounded by laughter.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:28.762
Yes, anywhere would have
done as a place to call home.

00:01:28.762 --> 00:01:34.301
Farewell, sunshine!
The night rises up invitingly.

00:01:34.501 --> 00:01:39.573
It's okay, this world moves
in a way that will connect us.

00:01:39.807 --> 00:01:46.280
So that we can all smile
together once again.

00:02:07.668 --> 00:02:10.971
Kurama, what's going on?

00:02:13.207 --> 00:02:17.077
If nothing happens,
what will become of Koto?

00:02:25.686 --> 00:02:26.654
What's happening?!

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:40.968
A virus?

00:03:13.233 --> 00:03:14.068
Look!

00:03:14.068 --> 00:03:15.235
It's Mom! It's Mom!

00:03:15.469 --> 00:03:16.270
Sis!

00:03:25.512 --> 00:03:30.017
Mom's Back, and oh,
Dad's Back, Too

00:03:30.017 --> 00:03:31.485
Chapter 19: The
Present (13)/ Reunion

00:03:48.836 --> 00:03:49.536
Mom?

00:04:02.449 --> 00:04:03.050
Koto?

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:03.984
Mom?

00:04:04.952 --> 00:04:05.786
Koto?

00:04:06.186 --> 00:04:07.121
Mom!

00:04:07.454 --> 00:04:08.722
Mom!

00:04:09.289 --> 00:04:11.558
Mom! It's me, Koto!

00:04:11.558 --> 00:04:13.694
I've been looking for you this whole time!

00:04:13.894 --> 00:04:16.530
| came to get you!

00:04:27.474 --> 00:04:28.609
You're really...

00:04:30.344 --> 00:04:31.445
Koto, aren't you?

00:04:42.489 --> 00:04:44.792
| missed you, Mom!

00:04:50.297 --> 00:04:52.399
Me, too, Koto!

00:04:53.233 --> 00:04:53.734
Yeah!

00:05:14.354 --> 00:05:16.323
All right!

00:05:28.769 --> 00:05:31.772
There's so much I want
to ask you right now...

00:05:33.006 --> 00:05:35.309
But for now, let's go home!

00:05:41.648 --> 00:05:42.816
Everybody's waiting.

00:05:59.633 --> 00:06:00.634
Koto!

00:06:01.068 --> 00:06:01.735
Koto!

00:06:02.035 --> 00:06:03.036
Koto!

00:06:03.704 --> 00:06:04.571
Koto!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.609
You've gotten so pretty, Princess.

00:06:10.611 --> 00:06:13.881
Oh my, and you grew up so fast, Kurama!

00:06:14.214 --> 00:06:17.017
And you are as beautiful as ever, Koto.

00:06:17.251 --> 00:06:17.885
Thank you.

00:06:22.456 --> 00:06:24.258
| thought I was going to die!

00:06:24.524 --> 00:06:26.960
| was sure I was going to die!

00:06:28.528 --> 00:06:29.596
Poor thing.

00:06:30.964 --> 00:06:32.799
Look at how you've grown!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.969
Can you sleep alone now, Myoue?

00:06:35.969 --> 00:06:37.137
Shut up.

00:06:37.771 --> 00:06:39.640
And look at all the children you have!

00:06:39.973 --> 00:06:40.974
They're not mine!

00:06:40.974 --> 00:06:42.042
I'm kidding.

00:06:43.443 --> 00:06:44.177
Koto...

00:06:44.611 --> 00:06:45.512
Mom...

00:06:46.914 --> 00:06:48.215
I'm sorry.

00:06:48.482 --> 00:06:51.184
Your siblings made things really
hard for you, didn't they?

00:06:52.452 --> 00:06:53.553
Will you forgive them?

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:57.324
Yeah.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:02.663
I'm really glad I met you, Mom.

00:07:04.531 --> 00:07:05.499
Me, too.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.936
Welcome home!

00:07:08.936 --> 00:07:10.370
I'm home.

00:07:16.043 --> 00:07:18.045
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:07:18.045 --> 00:07:19.513
Chapter 20: The
Present (14)/ Return

00:07:20.681 --> 00:07:22.382
Oh, my! Oh, my!

00:07:23.116 --> 00:07:25.519
This place has really changed!

00:07:28.255 --> 00:07:29.222
It's Koto-sama!

00:07:30.324 --> 00:07:31.124
Koto-samal!

00:07:31.425 --> 00:07:33.026
Koto-samal!

00:07:33.193 --> 00:07:35.162
What an honor...

00:07:35.462 --> 00:07:36.797
The Council of Three, too.

00:07:44.538 --> 00:07:45.872
You know...

00:07:46.707 --> 00:07:47.841
We really stand out.

00:07:55.582 --> 00:07:56.883
You all worked together

00:07:56.883 --> 00:07:59.519
to protect the Looking Glass City,
just like you promised!

00:07:59.519 --> 00:08:01.254
I'm so proud of you three!

00:08:01.555 --> 00:08:04.191
Hey, Mom, let's go to the mountains!

00:08:04.191 --> 00:08:07.361
I'll throw a tea party for you!

00:08:07.361 --> 00:08:09.262
So you're in charge of
the mountains, huh?

00:08:09.262 --> 00:08:09.730
Yup!

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:13.100
And Myoue's in charge of slacking off.

00:08:13.333 --> 00:08:14.001
| am not.

00:08:14.634 --> 00:08:16.303
Then what are you in charge of?

00:08:16.303 --> 00:08:18.038
Babysitting is enough work.

00:08:18.038 --> 00:08:19.639
Hey, are you...

00:08:19.873 --> 00:08:21.575
...talking about us?

00:08:21.742 --> 00:08:23.410
That's so mean.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:25.278
Who else would I be talking about?

00:08:25.512 --> 00:08:27.080
You actually like us, don't you?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.849
If we weren't here, you'd cry!

00:08:29.182 --> 00:08:31.585
What a wimp!

00:08:31.752 --> 00:08:33.320
Shut up, you idiots!

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.756
So were things like
this your idea, Kurama?

00:08:39.493 --> 00:08:41.361
You're always so smart!

00:08:41.862 --> 00:08:43.263
| want to see more!

00:08:45.766 --> 00:08:47.234
So pretty!

00:08:47.234 --> 00:08:48.502
What is this?

00:08:49.202 --> 00:08:50.137
A monitor.

00:08:51.004 --> 00:08:52.105
A monitor?

00:08:53.273 --> 00:08:55.342
Does the color change
if you press this?

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:58.578
You shouldn't touch it too much.

00:08:59.146 --> 00:08:59.880
| shouldn't?

00:09:00.814 --> 00:09:03.183
It's not a machine that changes colors.

00:09:03.683 --> 00:09:06.787
So that's the mother of
the Council of Three?

00:09:07.254 --> 00:09:09.723
Did she leave before you got here?

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:11.124
Yes, I believe so.

00:09:11.391 --> 00:09:13.026
And she's my mom, too!

00:09:13.827 --> 00:09:15.062
You look nothing alike.

00:09:15.295 --> 00:09:16.897
Yes, we do!

00:09:17.097 --> 00:09:18.465
We totally do!

00:09:21.068 --> 00:09:21.835
Mother.

00:09:22.436 --> 00:09:23.503
| think that's enough.

00:09:24.304 --> 00:09:24.738
Huh?

00:09:26.907 --> 00:09:28.475
What happened, all of a sudden?

00:09:28.775 --> 00:09:30.744
You're alike, after all!

00:09:31.011 --> 00:09:33.847
What are you doing?

00:09:33.847 --> 00:09:34.781
<i>'M sorry!</i>

00:09:40.687 --> 00:09:42.222
We can skip my place.

00:09:42.222 --> 00:09:43.623
Oh, come on.

00:09:43.957 --> 00:09:45.292
| don't have anything to show you.

00:09:45.725 --> 00:09:46.927
| want to see it!

00:09:47.727 --> 00:09:49.296
It's so clean!

00:09:52.966 --> 00:09:54.301
You like cooking, don't you?

00:09:54.301 --> 00:09:55.335
Not really.

00:09:55.735 --> 00:09:57.904
You're such a hardworking boy!

00:09:58.472 --> 00:10:00.373
This is A, Un's, and my room!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:03.009
| told you to clean it up
before we left!

00:10:03.243 --> 00:10:04.010
Right!

00:10:04.177 --> 00:10:04.845
Right. Right.

00:10:15.055 --> 00:10:16.723
Drink up!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.125
Thank you.

00:10:20.594 --> 00:10:21.828
It's so good.

00:10:22.028 --> 00:10:23.163
Isn't it?

00:10:23.163 --> 00:10:25.599
It's just like the tea
| used to drink with you!

00:10:25.599 --> 00:10:26.466
That's right.

00:10:30.403 --> 00:10:31.605
| remember this.

00:10:32.205 --> 00:10:33.740
| can't believe you saved it.

00:10:34.174 --> 00:10:36.776
It's an important memory
of my time with you.

00:10:36.776 --> 00:10:38.311
| couldn't get rid of it.

00:10:39.412 --> 00:10:42.349
I'm so glad you're back.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:43.984
Yase...

00:10:46.019 --> 00:10:48.021
I'm sorry I disappeared so suddenly.

00:10:49.322 --> 00:10:50.090
It's okay...

00:10:52.325 --> 00:10:54.494
It's all okay now, Koto.

00:11:02.802 --> 00:11:04.204
That was so fun.

00:11:04.938 --> 00:11:07.440
Well, I'm going to
head back now, okay?

00:11:11.378 --> 00:11:11.845
Huh?

00:11:12.045 --> 00:11:13.346
Why?

00:11:13.346 --> 00:11:14.514
No!

00:11:14.514 --> 00:11:15.348
Why?

00:11:15.582 --> 00:11:17.284
You're finally back!

00:11:17.884 --> 00:11:20.187
| got to see that
everybody's doing well.

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:21.254
That's enough.

00:11:21.555 --> 00:11:22.422
And...

00:11:24.157 --> 00:11:27.227
| promised that when we came back,
we'd be together.

00:11:27.827 --> 00:11:30.830
Since I came without him,
he'll be mad.

00:11:32.232 --> 00:11:35.769
Dad'll come back
on his own eventually!

00:11:36.136 --> 00:11:36.803
Yase...

00:11:38.071 --> 00:11:40.774
Head back... but how?

00:11:41.007 --> 00:11:42.275
| don't want you to!

00:11:42.509 --> 00:11:44.077
I'm not doing that again, okay?

00:11:44.644 --> 00:11:48.014
How did you get here, anyway?

00:11:49.349 --> 00:11:50.750
Trade secret!

00:11:51.117 --> 00:11:52.619
You can't even get back.

00:11:53.386 --> 00:11:54.154
Ow!

00:11:54.721 --> 00:11:55.455
Koto.

00:12:00.393 --> 00:12:01.795
No!

00:12:03.063 --> 00:12:05.065
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:12:05.065 --> 00:12:06.533
Chapter 21: The
Present (15)/ Koto

00:12:14.708 --> 00:12:15.742
Mom!

00:12:21.448 --> 00:12:22.082
Koto.

00:12:46.273 --> 00:12:48.975
I'm sorry for making you
go through all this.

00:12:51.244 --> 00:12:54.047
No, it's okay.

00:13:00.387 --> 00:13:02.756
You've grown up, Koto.

00:13:04.291 --> 00:13:05.759
It really has been a long time.

00:13:06.192 --> 00:13:09.396
The last time we met was
when you were a little girl.

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:13.566
| saw you when I was a baby?

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:14.801
You sure did!

00:13:16.002 --> 00:13:17.370
You were this tiny.

00:13:19.939 --> 00:13:22.676
And we went to that place, too.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.544
Oh!

00:13:25.211 --> 00:13:26.880
| had no idea.

00:13:29.916 --> 00:13:32.319
Your dad didn't tell you anything?

00:13:34.354 --> 00:13:36.356
He didn't want to say anything.

00:13:36.823 --> 00:13:39.426
It was more like...

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.862
"You know already!
| don't have to tell you!"

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:45.265
That's how he came across.

00:13:48.535 --> 00:13:49.903
That sounds just like him.

00:13:51.905 --> 00:13:53.940
He's always been like that.

00:13:54.808 --> 00:13:57.277
| don't really get it.

00:14:07.153 --> 00:14:09.622
Your hair's nice and straight,
just like your dad's.

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:11.958
Is it?

00:14:12.392 --> 00:14:13.259
It is.

00:14:14.327 --> 00:14:15.328
Is it?

00:14:15.962 --> 00:14:16.930
It is.

00:14:18.531 --> 00:14:19.666
And the color my eyes?

00:14:20.133 --> 00:14:21.968
Yes, they're the same.

00:14:23.002 --> 00:14:24.170
And yours, too!

00:14:24.637 --> 00:14:25.538
That's right.

00:14:56.803 --> 00:14:57.670
Now, now.

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:03.376
Are you really going back there, Mom?

00:15:09.449 --> 00:15:10.583
| can tell!

00:15:10.917 --> 00:15:13.086
That's a holy place for
the Shrine, isn't it?

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:15.321
What were you doing there?

00:15:16.156 --> 00:15:16.823
Koto...

00:15:17.524 --> 00:15:21.528
Sensei and the people at the
Shrine won't tell me anything.

00:15:22.028 --> 00:15:23.897
But I want to know!

00:15:26.099 --> 00:15:31.204
About myself, about Dad, about you...

00:15:35.408 --> 00:15:39.145
When I first saw you,
| thought you were the priest.

00:15:41.114 --> 00:15:45.385
| thought you'd come to get me,
just like you'd promised.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.088
| thought that it'd taken
a long, long time,

00:15:49.289 --> 00:15:52.459
but you'd finally come to
fulfill your promise.

00:15:54.394 --> 00:15:57.764
But it's not that easy, is it?

00:16:02.902 --> 00:16:04.971
Koto, can you...

00:16:05.872 --> 00:16:10.877
...save that poor person,
trapped by their dreams?

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:21.521
The hole our little sister
tore open has already closed.

00:16:22.055 --> 00:16:23.857
And with the catalyst in this shape...

00:16:29.395 --> 00:16:30.497
Is something wrong?

00:16:31.431 --> 00:16:35.902
Something... is bothering me.

00:16:36.703 --> 00:16:41.574
How could she be so sure she
was going to return?

00:16:42.475 --> 00:16:45.078
Well, I'm going to
head back now, okay?

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:48.781
How?

00:17:01.528 --> 00:17:02.295
What happened?

00:17:31.724 --> 00:17:33.993
You're not staying there tonight?

00:17:34.761 --> 00:17:35.128
Yeah.

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:44.771
What?

00:17:45.572 --> 00:17:47.574
This is my first time seeing this room.

00:17:47.574 --> 00:17:49.142
There's nothing in it, is there?

00:17:50.877 --> 00:17:52.745
Your girlfriend never comes here.

00:17:52.979 --> 00:17:54.414
She's not my girlfriend.

00:17:55.682 --> 00:17:57.216
She's too good for me.

00:18:01.154 --> 00:18:03.089
You always say that.

00:18:03.456 --> 00:18:05.558
"For me,” "for me."

00:18:09.395 --> 00:18:12.498
Don't you get tired of
saying that kind of stuff?

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.435
What's with you?

00:18:15.768 --> 00:18:16.903
Nothing.

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.339
You're lucky.

00:18:19.672 --> 00:18:21.908
To have a past you
can get gloomy about.

00:18:23.009 --> 00:18:24.210
I'm jealous.

00:18:27.046 --> 00:18:29.515
You have one, too, don't you?

00:18:29.983 --> 00:18:30.850
| don't.

00:18:31.951 --> 00:18:33.519
| don't...

00:18:35.121 --> 00:18:37.890
All I have is the future.

00:18:41.661 --> 00:18:44.597
| keep telling myself
| have to go forward...

00:18:45.198 --> 00:18:46.866
without knowing anything at all.

00:18:49.202 --> 00:18:49.869
Hey.

00:18:52.038 --> 00:18:53.172
What's gotten into you?

00:19:04.851 --> 00:19:05.318
Hey.

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.422
|I won't know if you don't say anything.

00:19:11.391 --> 00:19:15.061
Everybody... everybody keeps
asking me to do things!

00:19:15.061 --> 00:19:15.928
Why?

00:19:16.229 --> 00:19:16.929
Koto...

00:19:17.096 --> 00:19:18.831
There are lots of things I want to ask!

00:19:18.831 --> 00:19:20.867
Things I want your help with!

00:19:21.567 --> 00:19:24.937
But nobody tells me anything!

00:19:25.338 --> 00:19:26.339
Hey!

00:19:26.339 --> 00:19:27.807
Calm down, Koto!

00:19:27.807 --> 00:19:29.042
| can't take it anymore!

00:19:29.042 --> 00:19:31.444
I've got my own problems!

00:19:53.766 --> 00:19:56.102
It's because you're special.

00:19:58.771 --> 00:20:01.040
That's just how it is, Koto.

00:20:08.014 --> 00:20:09.782
Sensei?

00:20:10.616 --> 00:20:12.885
Well, you'll just have to get used to it.

00:20:15.688 --> 00:20:16.989
Sensei...

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:18.691
Sensei!

00:20:24.731 --> 00:20:27.800
You're crying again, wimp?

00:20:28.101 --> 00:20:30.903
You're such a baby, shrimp.

00:20:31.637 --> 00:20:34.907
It's been a long time since
I've seen your tears.

00:20:37.076 --> 00:20:37.944
Sensei!

00:20:38.578 --> 00:20:39.545
Ne and Ko, too!

00:20:39.812 --> 00:20:41.914
What are you doing here?

00:20:42.415 --> 00:20:43.983
This is the Looking Glass City!

00:20:45.051 --> 00:20:45.618
Yes.

00:20:47.353 --> 00:20:48.287
| know that.

00:21:05.204 --> 00:21:06.005
What was that?

00:21:12.578 --> 00:21:14.881
Are you the priest?

00:21:15.748 --> 00:21:19.318
It's been a long time, Yakushimaru.

00:21:21.554 --> 00:21:24.123
No, now you're...

00:21:25.892 --> 00:21:28.194
Priest Myoue, aren't you?

00:21:30.363 --> 00:21:31.998
How did you get here, Sensei?

00:21:32.365 --> 00:21:34.801
You guys were getting out of hand.

00:21:35.101 --> 00:21:37.103
You idiots were having a party.

00:21:37.436 --> 00:21:39.772
And it's made a mess for us.

00:21:41.841 --> 00:21:46.846
| can't believe what you did,
you little tomboy.

00:22:34.493 --> 00:22:35.795
The rest of that dream...

00:22:36.295 --> 00:22:37.496
Why now?

00:22:38.397 --> 00:22:40.766
There can only be one reason.

00:22:41.968 --> 00:22:43.269
It wasn't me!

00:22:44.604 --> 00:22:48.140
What the Shrine feared,
and tried to isolate, was...

00:22:49.709 --> 00:22:50.943
What do you mean?

00:22:51.911 --> 00:22:55.248
How did you get here, Koto?

00:22:55.882 --> 00:22:56.716
How?

00:22:57.083 --> 00:22:59.051
| made an entrance!

00:22:59.485 --> 00:23:03.489
There wasn't one, so I bullied
my way in with Aratama.

00:23:04.523 --> 00:23:07.360
You did, too.
With your sword, right?

00:23:11.631 --> 00:23:15.868
From the look on your face,
there's no doubt, then.

00:23:16.969 --> 00:23:20.006
Jeez... Nothing has changed.

00:23:21.841 --> 00:23:25.845
Dad's the one who brings
all the problems.

00:23:28.314 --> 00:23:32.051
And our lovely little sister,
too, I suppose.

00:23:33.519 --> 00:23:36.188
| found Mom!

00:23:36.722 --> 00:23:38.925
Aren't you glad, Sensei?

00:23:47.266 --> 00:23:53.673
I'd even cut things off, (Ouch!)
to prove the fact I exist.

00:23:55.508 --> 00:24:01.614
Though eternal lies surround me,
they're my safety line.

00:24:03.416 --> 00:24:10.022
"Wanna take you high?"
The galaxy shakes. You smile.

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:18.064
I want to touch you. I don't want
to hear that it's forbidden.

00:24:19.865 --> 00:24:23.502
Moved to emotion by arguments,
| cast aside reason.

00:24:23.502 --> 00:24:28.641
I enter a game of risk that's
devoid of reason.

00:24:31.911 --> 00:24:36.682
It's resplendent with rare pain.

00:24:40.119 --> 00:24:45.191
Mistaking the real for the unreal.

00:24:48.327 --> 00:24:52.231
It transcends all understanding.

00:24:52.231 --> 00:24:53.165
So, fight!

00:24:56.435 --> 00:24:57.303
So, fight!

00:25:00.539 --> 00:25:01.374
So, fight!

00:25:08.581 --> 00:25:09.482
So, fight!

00:25:10.049 --> 00:25:12.018
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:25:13.552 --> 00:25:16.088
The Looking Glass City
is going to be destroyed?

00:25:16.088 --> 00:25:17.556
That's big trouble!

00:25:17.957 --> 00:25:19.859
This is no joke, is it?

00:25:19.859 --> 00:25:20.993
Are we going to be okay?

00:25:21.727 --> 00:25:23.729
But the High Priest is here,

00:25:23.996 --> 00:25:25.297
so it'll all work out, right?

00:25:26.699 --> 00:25:29.769
This is all... my fault?

00:25:30.036 --> 00:25:33.539
<i>O ERNG TS BEne Next time:
"Troublesome Talks Here and There."</i>

00:25:33.706 --> 00:25:36.942
Hey! You didn't tell me about this, Sensei!

00:25:37.176 --> 00:25:38.444
What do we do now?
